{"id":"h-0189","domain":"support escalation tree","names":["Support","Tier1","Tier2","Engineers"],"text":"Here is the support tree. Connect Tier1 to Tier2 with a plain line, and Tier2 to Engineers with a dotted line. Move Support to the top center. Who is directly linked to Tier2? And how many connections does Engineers have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Tier1","to":"Tier2","arrow":"none"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Tier2","to":"Engineers","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Support","position":"top"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"Tier2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Engineers"}}]}
{"id":"h-0190","domain":"chemical reaction diagram","names":["Reactant","Catalyst","Product","Heat2"],"text":"For our reaction diagram, put Catalyst above Reactant and make it a small purple diamond. Connect Reactant to Product with a dashed arrow labeled yields. Is Heat2 reachable from Reactant? Also which shape is the leftmost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Catalyst","position":"above","anchor":"Reactant"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Catalyst","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Catalyst","color":"purple"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Catalyst","shape":"diamond"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Reactant","to":"Product","style":"dashed","label":"yields"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Reactant","to":"Heat2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0191","domain":"wedding vendor plan","names":["Florist","Caterer","Venue","Band"],"text":"Pls can u move Band to the right of Caterer, I want the music near the food. Make Venue a huge white square, its the main room. Is Florist connected to Venue? Also which is the largest thing on the plan now?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Band","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Caterer"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Venue","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Venue","color":"white"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Venue","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Florist","anchor":"Venue"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"biggest"}}]}
{"id":"h-0192","domain":"weather front map","names":["Cold","Warm","Front","Storm"],"text":"Connect Cold to Front with a dotted line labeled advances, then Warm to Front with a plain arrow. Make Storm a large blue star and place it below Front. What is the degree of Front? Also, is there any square on the map yet?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Cold","to":"Front","style":"dotted","label":"advances"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Warm","to":"Front"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Storm","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Storm","color":"blue"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Storm","shape":"star"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Storm","position":"below","anchor":"Front"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Front"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"exists","shape":"square"}}]}
{"id":"h-0193","domain":"beehive hierarchy","names":["Queen","Workers","Drones","Hive"],"text":"In my beehive diagram the Queen should sit above the Workers, so move Queen above Workers. Make Drones a tiny yellow circle. How many connections does Hive have? And which shape is the most connected one overall?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Queen","position":"above","anchor":"Workers"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Drones","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Drones","color":"yellow"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Drones","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Hive"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"mostConnected"}}]}
{"id":"h-0194","domain":"stadium section plan","names":["Field","Section1","Section2","Gate4"],"text":"Please move Section2 to the right of Section1 and make Gate4 a huge navy triangle. Which section is the closest to Field? Are any sections not navy? Thanks for your help today.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Section2","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Section1"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Gate4","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Gate4","color":"navy"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Gate4","shape":"triangle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Field","superlative":"closest"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"exists","notColor":"navy"}}]}
{"id":"h-0195","domain":"micro frontend architecture","names":["Shell","Cart2","Profile","Search"],"text":"Please connect Shell to Cart2 and Shell to Profile with plain arrows. Then connect Shell to Search with a dashed line. Is Search connected to Profile directly? Also rename Cart2 to Basket.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Shell","to":"Cart2,Profile"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Shell","to":"Search","style":"dashed"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Search","anchor":"Profile"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"rename","target":"Cart2","name":"Basket"}}]}
{"id":"h-0196","domain":"cupcake recipe steps","names":["Mix","Bake","Cool","Frost"],"text":"I'm making cupcakes and the steps are kind of confusing. Put Frost after Cool, so move it below Cool. Connect Mix to Bake with a plain arrow labeled 20min. Make Cool a small teal square. How many shapes are teal right now?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Frost","position":"below","anchor":"Cool"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Mix","to":"Bake","label":"20min"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Cool","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Cool","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Cool","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"teal"}}]}
{"id":"h-0197","domain":"traffic intersection sim","names":["NorthRd","EastRd","Light","Crosswalk"],"text":"Place Light at the center of the intersection, then move Crosswalk near Light. Connect NorthRd to Light with a dashed arrow, and EastRd to Light with a solid arrow. Which shape is closest to Light? Is NorthRd bigger than EastRd?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Light","position":"center"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Crosswalk","position":"near","anchor":"Light"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"NorthRd","to":"Light","style":"dashed"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"EastRd","to":"Light"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Light","superlative":"closest"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"NorthRd","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"EastRd"}}]}
{"id":"h-0198","domain":"hospital room map","names":["Room1","Room2","Hall4","Nurse4"],"text":"Oops, the last move was wrong, so please undo that. Then make Room2 a huge teal rectangle. Who is directly connected to Hall4? Also, which shape is the leftmost one?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"undo"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Room2","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Room2","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Room2","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"Hall4"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0199","domain":"hot desk area","names":["DeskA","DeskB","Printer","Kitchen5"],"text":"We are reorganizing the hot desk area, so put Printer between DeskA and DeskB. Make Kitchen5 a tiny orange circle. Is DeskA directly connected to Printer? And how many shapes are orange now?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Printer","position":"between","anchor":"DeskA,DeskB"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Kitchen5","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Kitchen5","color":"orange"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Kitchen5","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"DeskA","anchor":"Printer"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"orange"}}]}
{"id":"h-0200","domain":"lab safety map","names":["Exit5","Eyewash","Extinguisher","Alarm2"],"text":"Our lab safety map needs red markers, so color Extinguisher red and Eyewash red too. Move Alarm2 above Exit5, since people see alarms first. Which shapes are not red? Could you label Eyewash as Eye Wash?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Extinguisher","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Eyewash","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Alarm2","position":"above","anchor":"Exit5"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"label","target":"Eyewash","label":"Eye Wash"}}]}
